"nA": {
"x": 3330,
"y": 0,
"w": 420,
"size": "m",
"fill": "gray",
"text": "DESIGNS v3 · FULL VISUAL STYLE (22 OCT)\n\nEvery screen is now designed in the approved visual style: logo, rounded cards on linen, coloured session pictures, brand fonts.\n\nAmber tag = waiting on you (wording, pictures).\nPurple tag = +2 weeks release.\n\nNames and numbers are examples. Session pictures are placeholders until the illustrations are ready.",
"maxH": 560
},
"tB": {
"x": 0,
"y": 984,
"text": "Customer booking site · my account",
"kind": "title1",
"maxW": 3210
},
"nB": {
"x": 3330,
"y": 1244,
"w": 420,
"size": "m",
"fill": "green",
"text": "DECISIONS BUILT IN (21 OCT)\n\n• Week list only, no day/month view\n• Free cancellation until 20:00 the evening before; after that, Cancel becomes Message us\n• 1 parent + up to 2 children per booking\n• Open play: 1 credit or 150,000 VND per child, parents free\n• Several dates are picked one by one; nothing repeats\n• No 'Pay now' line, no waitlist",
"maxH": 620
},
"tC": {
"x": 0,
"y": 2228,
"text": "Staff app · computer (managers and instructors)",
"kind": "title1",
"maxW": 6720
},
"nC": {
"x": 6840,
"y": 2488,
"w": 420,
"size": "m",
"fill": "blue",
"text": "ROLES\n\nInstructors don't see Catalog, Reports, Staff or Settings, and can't sell packs, record payments or restore credits.\n\nThe database refuses these actions too, not just the menu.",
"maxH": 520
},
"nD": {
"x": 6840,
"y": 3788,
"w": 420,
"size": "m",
"fill": "green",
"text": "ANSWERED 21 OCT\n\nWhen staff drag a session to a new time, the bookings move with it and everyone booked gets an email. A move that would overlap another session is blocked.",
"maxH": 520
},
"tE": {
"x": 0,
"y": 4828,
"text": "Staff app · instructor's phone",
"kind": "title1",
"maxW": 1800
},
"nE": {
"x": 1920,
"y": 5088,
"w": 420,
"size": "m",
"fill": "blue",
"text": "The most common way bookings will be made: open the session, search the name, tap Book. The customer still gets the confirmation email.",
"maxH": 400
},
"tF": {
